    <string name="default_title">Make Big Screen the home screen</string>
    <string name="default_text">Google TV does not let you choose another home screen in its settings. Turn on developer options and network debugging on the TV, then run these commands from a computer with adb:\n\nadb connect TV_IP\nadb shell pm disable-user --user 0 com.google.android.apps.tv.launcherx\nadb shell pm disable-user --user 0 com.google.android.tungsten.setupwraith\n\nIf the second command says \"Unknown package\", that device does not have it and nothing else is needed. The Home button then opens Big Screen. To bring Google TV back:\n\nadb shell pm enable com.google.android.apps.tv.launcherx\nadb shell pm enable com.google.android.tungsten.setupwraith\n\nOn Android TV without Google TV, pressing Home usually lets you pick Big Screen directly.</string>
